          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our business is characterized by rapid change as well as new and disruptive technologies. We face formidable competition in every aspect of our business, including but not limited to, from:",
        "text_hash": "9c656dbe7cebba6a9d7ee83a4da50ab8f5826d747678ac1ddf26500f9da34c74",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
